/E (Service delivery was strengthened through effective cold chain management systems, ensuring vaccine potency from storage to field administration. The intervention was implemented through a community-based vaccination model, leveraging CAHWs and VPPs to provide door-to-door and village-level outreach, which significantly improved coverage and community trust. )
