/S /P
/P 107 0 R
/E (The intervention focused on strengthening technical and business skills, monitoring progress, and addressing implementation challenges. Positive outcomes included improved gardening practices, crop diversification, and increased resilience among participants, with several adopting adaptive strategies such as relocation of gardens to improve water access.)
