1770 0 obj
<<
/Title (In March 2026, the HARAF SRHR team, in collaboration with community PALS facilitators, successfully implemented a series of life skills sessions for adolescents and parents across five intervention communities Fufore, Gurin, Girei 1 & 2, and Jabi Lamba through the Conrad N. Hilton Funded Project. The sessions were strategically designed to equip participants with the knowledge, attitudes, and skills required to make informed decisions for improved health, wellbeing, and positive family relationships.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1758 0 R
/Next 1777 0 R
>>
endobj
